      "rationale": "Only Roster has a permission model; it becomes the single role set and the one permission check, with a mapping from every source role.",
      "behaviour": "Roles viewer (read), editor (read, write), admin (read, write, manage_roles); can(role, permission) denies unknown roles; map_source_role maps A user->editor, B member->viewer, C viewer/editor/admin unchanged, and raises KeyError for anything else.",
